#tutor04
#tutor05
From : Colonel K.Rorscham
       Vandaum Headquarters

For : % &
      Royan base

Object : LANDING AT TARZ-AKAL

Don't show off &, your conquest of Narnaul does
not impress me, after the losses the ennemy endured during
the storming of Nelkan, it was child's play to regain the base,
that was the reason why you were entrusted with this mission.
Anyway, let's forget that.

The communists hold the Tarz-Akal mines and that is the
reason for their power in the region. You will leave without
delay for the island of MAKTAR to the NORTH EAST of Tarz-Akal.
Our base is constantly being attacked by the enemy.

Your mission will be to re-enforce the base and to prepare
troop transport with a view to landing at Tarz-Akal.

If you fail at Tarz-Akal I advise you not to come back,
because the punishment you will get from me might be worse.

You should have already left.